; OpenADS ACE-compatible DLL exports — x86 variant.
;
; All entry points use __cdecl convention (undecorated names).  This
; matches the generic openads_ace.def and lets hbmk2 / MinGW projects
; link without @N stdcall-decoration mismatches.
;
; If you need __stdcall-decorated (@N) names for Harbour's contrib/rddads,
; use openads_ace_x86_stdcall.def instead.

LIBRARY
EXPORTS
